  "id": "herpetic-neuralgia",
  "term": "herpetic neuralgia",
  "definition": "Herpetic neuralgia, as supported here in the form of post-herpetic neuralgia, is a neuropathic pain condition that can follow herpes zoster. It is described as the most important complication of shingles and is linked to reactivation of latent varicella-zoster virus.",
